terms.medium_def:
A man from the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.8.36; 
only referred to as Moza (מוֹצָא); 
a son of Zimri; 
father of Binea.

A man from the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.46; 
only referred to as Moza (מוֹצָא); 
son of Caleb and Ephah; 
a brother of Haran and Gazez; 
half-brother of: Hur, Jesher, Shobab, Ardon, Mesha, Sheber, Tirhanah, Regem(?), Jotham(?), Geshan(?), Pelet(?), Ephah(?), Shaaph(?), Shaaph, Sheva and Achsah.
